Sheet":"Interest","kind":"loan","moneyColumns":[2,4]},{"source":"07 Bills/Bills Received November 1-5, 2026.xlsx","locator":"Received sheet: five bills received November 1 to 5; Booked in October sheet: the October AP ledger","sha256":"530e4283cf07a1973f60c85912ad66e8da677c8f49ce20abddfa07c0a14755a1","name":"E09 Bills Received","originalSheet":"Received","kind":"bills","moneyColumns":[6]},{"source":"07 Bills/Bills Received November 1-5, 2026.xlsx","locator":"Received sheet: five bills received November 1 to 5; Booked in October sheet: the October AP ledger","sha256":"530e4283cf07a1973f60c85912ad66e8da677c8f49ce20abddfa07c0a14755a1","name":"E10 AP Booked October","originalSheet":"Booked in October","kind":"bills","moneyColumns":[4]},{"source":"08 Checklist/Close Checklist - October 2026.xlsx","locator":"Checklist sheet: C-01 to C-10 as they stood when the close began","sha256":"981d5267794bb6656afe73df960441402da2f19c9cbf99771f7e8694ae8877a7","name":"E11 Close Checklist","originalSheet":"Checklist","kind":"checklist","moneyColumns":[]},{"source":"06 Payroll/Payroll Register - Period Ending October 23.pdf","locator":"Page 1, read line by line from the PDF text","sha256":"a74da15568d480cf9c36ef8b47fad0da5b701af4bb0bc9b59d81f2cf890ba29e","name":"E12 Payroll Register","originalSheet":null,"kind":"payroll","moneyColumns":[2,3,4,5]},{"source":"07 Bills/FSS-0171 Fernhollow Site Services.pdf","locator":"Page 1, read line by line from the PDF text","sha256":"b3111d27fe5de2260b4eee6debf6411584bc5b210ea6f6a6b8b7c53d3318f859","name":"E13 FSS-0171 Invoice","originalSheet":null,"kind":"invoice","moneyColumns":[1]},{"source":"06 Payroll/Payroll Register - Period Ending October 23.pdf","locator":"Page 1","sha256":"a74da15568d480cf9c36ef8b47fad0da5b701af4bb0bc9b59d81f2cf890ba29e","name":"PAY Page 1","originalSheet":null,"kind":"payroll","moneyColumns":[]},{"source":"07 Bills/FSS-0171 Fernhollow Site Services.pdf","locator":"Page 1","sha256":"b3111d27fe5de2260b4eee6debf6411584bc5b210ea6f6a6b8b7c53d3318f859","name":"INV Page 1","originalSheet":null,"kind":"invoice","moneyColumns":[]},{"source":"09 Procedures/HANGS Close Procedures v2.1.docx","locator":"Clauses CLOSE-1 to CLOSE-7; Appendix A, accounts used in close entries","sha256":"7f3a577cb6f87fba4d75ece3292b832fb98fdd2331ae99e1d7e39085204465ce","name":"E14 Close Procedures","originalSheet":null,"kind":"procedures","moneyColumns":[]}],"openItems":[{"id":"Insurance Amortized Twice · CLOSE-3","status":"open","amount":"3240.00","explanation":"General ledger 1300 is $3,240.00 below the prepaid schedule after October's amortization. After RJ-01, GL 1300 would be $56,160.00; the prepaid schedule ends October at $59,400.00. In September, GL 1300 took $11,880.00 of amortization: the recurring RJ-01 for $8,640.00 and manual entry JE-2609-044 for $3,240.00, which is one month of policy GL-2026 already inside RJ-01. Confirm the manual entry is the duplicate, then reverse it: AJ-01 puts $3,240.00 back in 1300 Prepaid Insurance."},{"id":"Excavator Missing From Register · CLOSE-4","status":"open","amount":"815.48","explanation":"KRE-2207, compact excavator, is in GL 1500 at $68,500.00 but not on the fixed asset register. GL 1500 carries $141,100.00; the register lists $72,600.00. The difference, $68,500.00, is AP-10405 from Kestrel Ridge Equipment on October 6. Placed in service in October, it takes a full month of depreciation under CLOSE-4: $68,500.00 over 84 months is $815.48. AJ-02 books October's depreciation; add the asset to the register so November's RJ-03 includes it. This uses the cost booked in GL 1500; if the AP review's proposed full-cost entry for KRE-2207 is posted, recompute."},{"id":"Recurring Interest Held · CLOSE-2, CLOSE-6","status":"open","amount":"1453.35","explanation":"RJ-04 carries $1,406.47 of interest; the note's October interest is $1,453.35. $248,000.00 at 6.90% for October's 31 days, actual/365, is $1,453.35, and the Ridgeway loan schedule agrees. The recurring schedule still carries September's 30-day amount, $1,406.47, $46.88 short. Under CLOSE-2 the line is held, not forced to the schedule; AJ-03 proposes the supported amount instead. Change RJ-04 to compute from the days in each month."},{"id":"October Work Billed in November · CLOSE-1","status":"open","amount":"12460.00","explanation":"Fernhollow Site Services invoice FSS-0171 for $12,460.00, received November 4, is for October work and is not in the October ledger. Invoice FSS-0171 is dated November 3 and was received November 4, after month-end. Its service period is October 5 to October 30: all October. It is not among the 28 bills booked in October. AJ-04 accrues $12,460.00 to 1400 Homes Under Construction, job 27-05, cost code 02-200, against 2100 Accrued Liabilities, and reverses November 1 when the bill is entered."},{"id":"C-08 Customer deposits roll-forward, GL 2400","status":"open","amount":null,"explanation":"In Progress · Outside This Run. Escrow statements due November 6."},{"id":"C-10 Controller review and sign-off","status":"open","amount":null,"explanation":"Open · Needs the Controller. Review the proposed entries, the adjusted trial balance and this checklist (CLOSE-7)."}],"incomplete":true,"research":null}